ffers B.A with major in History , affiliated to Dibrugarh University. The department has three full time faculty. The department is well equipped with library/books and organizes seminar, workshops on regular basis. We are looking for bright and motivated students who want to take History as a career option.\nFaculties\nMr. Rupam Tamuly, HOD\nAsscoiate Professor\nHistory\nDate of Joining: 25/03/1998\ntamulyrupam37@gmail.com\n9678459102\nRead More\nMrs. Jyotirekha Gogoi\nAsscoiate Professor\nHistory\nDate of Joining: 25/03/1998\njyotirekhag@gmail.com\n9854278016\nRead More\nDr. Pankaj Bhuyan\nAsscoiate Professor\nHistory\nDate of Joining: 25/03/1998\npankajbhuyan2011@yahoo.com\n9435208044\nRead More\nCourses/Outcomes\n1. H.S in Arts (AHSEC)\nFor syllabus click here: https://ahsec.assam.gov.in/index.php/syllabus/\n2. B.A Major in HISTORY (CBCS)\nFor syllabus click here: https://dibru.ac.in/regulation-syllabi-of-ug-cbcs/\n3.\nClick here to view Course outcomes\nNotifications\nPapers/Reports\nStudent List\nClick here to view document\nGallery\nContact Us\nprincipal.jgc@gmail.com\nKhumtai, Golaghat, Assam\n(India), Pin – 785619\nQuick Location\nIGNOU\nUniversity Grant Commission\nGetting to NAAC\nDirectorate Of Higher Education\nGuwahati University\nDibrugarh University\nImportant Pages\nAlumni Association\nParent Association\nIQAC\nDHE Updates\nRUSA\nGallery\nDownloads\n© 2025 JOYA GOGOI COLLEGE | All Rights Reserved | Designed by AIO Digital Solutions\nOffice Login\nFaculty Login\nStudent Login\nDigital Diary\nNewsletter\nmodal-check\nDismiss ad\nDismiss ad\nThis will close in\n0\nseconds", "links": [{"label": "+91-9876543210", "url": "tel:+91-9876543210"}, {"label": "principal.jgc@gmail.com", "url": "mailto:principal.jgc@gmail.com"}, {"label": "Office Login", "url": "https://jgcollege.ac.in/department-of-history/"}, {"label": "Faculty Login", "url": "https://jgcollege.ac.in/department-of-history/"}, {"label": "Student Login", "url": "https://jgcollege.ac.in/department